OL,3,ACrazy Rich Asians to return as TV show
OL,4,Awith original film's stars
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour of the stars of 2018's Crazy Rich
OL,7,FAsians film are reprising their roles
OL,8,Ffor a TV show of the same name.
OL,10,FThe series will pick up events after
OL,11,Fthe end of the hit film, with Constance
OL,12,FWu and Henry Golding playing their lead
OL,13,Froles of Rachel and Nick, while Ronny
OL,14,FChieng is back as Eddie and Oscar
OL,15,Fwinner Michelle Yeoh will have a
OL,16,Frecurring role as Nick's mother
OL,17,FEleanor.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
